<title>PAKISTAN: TABLE-Pakistan Parke Davis H1 net dips.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Pakistan Parke Davis H1 net dips.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended May 31, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		 397 vs 384</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit    108 vs 116</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit    75 vs  79</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Parke Davis &amp; Company Ltd. The company, which manufactures pharmaceutical products, has not announced any interim dividend. The company says it has carried forward 76 million vs 80 million unappropriated profit to the balance sheet. -- Karachi Newsroom 9221-568</p>
</text>
